    },
    "Vault signs you in in the system browser and leases a short-lived MySQL password. The lease is never saved in the favorite." : {

    },
    "Vault- or OIDC-issued ephemeral database credentials are not shipped yet. They need a broader account-provider model, interactive browser or device-code flows, token and role selection UX, and clear trust boundaries around refresh in foreground windows, monitors, and widgets. The connection model now has typed authentication extension points so those providers can be added without redesigning every driver or form." : {

